## Project description
MFMS is a menu-driven C99 console program that helps a municipality keep track of employees, departmental budgets, suppliers and assets, and produce basic reports. It is the foundation version of the system and will be extended in Project B.

## System features
- Employee management: add, display, search and calculate salary information.
- Budget management: enter budgets and expenditure, calculate remaining budget and identify departments over budget.
- Supplier management: add, display, search and compare suppliers.
- Asset management: add, display, search and report on municipal assets.
- Reports: employee, budget, supplier and asset reports.
- Input validation for menu choices and key numeric/text inputs.

