## Compilation instructions
In the project folder, run:
```bash
gcc -std=c99 -Wall -Wextra main.c input.c employees.c budget.c suppliers.c assets.c reports.c -o mfms
```

## How to run
On Windows:
```text
mfms.exe
```
On Linux/macOS:
```bash
./mfms
```
